id: autonomous-glass-soldiers-first-effect
name: Autonomous Glass Soldiers
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: autonomous-glass-soldiers
fromEffect: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Autonomous Glass Soldiers's first effect, as a Maneuver: up to 8(bT) Ki, a Glass Knight for every 4(bT) on a Glass Square.
text: >
  (1)-[1/Round, Ruling]: As a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 Action, spend up to 8(bT) Ki Points. For every 4(bT) Ki Points spent, select an unoccupied square with the Glass Environmental Quality and create a ‘Glass Knight’ (that square loses the Glass Environmental Quality after the Glass Knight is created).

---

# How many asked - 4(bT) Ki each, 2 at most - with Copy in the Mirror how many are Glass Copies instead, paid and said on its card
# (chat.mjs glassKnights).
[on used]
glassKnights();
